<title>USA: TABLE-Global Marine Q2 shr $0.35 vs $0.14.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Global Marine Q2 shr $0.35 vs $0.14.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>				  Three months ended June 30,</p>
<p>					    1997	    1996</p>
<p>Earnings per share(1)	 $     0.35     $    0.14</p>
<p>Net income			    59,100	  24,100</p>
<p>Revenues			     233,000	 160,000</p>
<p>Avg common and common</p>
<p>equivalent shares:</p>
<p>    Primary			  170,700	 167,500</p>
<p>    Fully diluted		  176,600	 175,000</p>
<p>6 MONTHS</p>
<p>Earnings per share (2)	$     0.63	    0.23</p>
<p>Net income			   107,900	  39,000</p>
<p>Revenues			     443,000	 283,000</p>
<p>Avg common and common</p>
<p>equivalent shares</p>
<p>    Primary			  170,400	 167,200</p>
<p>    Fully diluted		  176,500	 174,400</p>
<p>NOTES:</p>
<p>(1) Results for the second quarter of 1997 are before a net credit to deferred income taxes of $25.0 million, or an additional $0.14 per share.</p>
<p>(2) Results for the first half of 1997 are before a net credit to deferred income taxes of $55 million, or an additional $0.33 per share.</p>
<p>Taking these into account, net income per common share for the second quarter of 1997 is $0.49, primary, and $0.48, fully diluted, on net income of $84.1 million.</p>
<p>Net income per common share for the six months ended June 30 is $0.96, primary and $0.92, fully diluted, on net income of $162.9 million.</p>
<p>--((New York Newsdesk 212 459-1610))</p>
